 'Separate trusted policy from untrusted questions, documents and tool results. Normalize text, remove hidden control characters, escape structural delimiters and mark stable boundaries, order and source IDs. An independent extractor returns only fact, quote and source_id. Validate the schema, bounds, source existence and exact continuous quotations, then discard raw material before answering. Labels and encoding reduce confusion; text concatenation is not native privilege enforcement.',
